# Shell scripts run through `sh`, which treats a trailing CR as part of the
# command: a hook fails with `$'\r': command not found`, and a CR on the shebang
# makes Docker report the entrypoint itself as `no such file or directory`. Git
# for Windows checks out with CRLF by default, so the line endings have to be
# pinned here or both are broken for anyone who clones this template on Windows.
.githooks/* text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
